  "formationType": "simpleIdeograph",
  "visualTeachingNotes": [
    "The sun and a crescent moon shown together.",
    "Oracle places a round sun with an inner mark beside a tall crescent moon; both celestial pictures are directly recognizable.",
    "Regular 明 fixes 日 on the left and 月 on the right, making the original pairing of sun and moon legible again in standardized characters."
  ],
